F6-PRICE-B: FAITHFUL PER-TARGET (BATCH-B / target-only) COUNTERFACTUAL PRICING
HARNESS — SINGLES ONLY. Build + preflight-gate + (gated) full parallel run.
No decomposition, no inequality, no estimation, no EUROMOD SYSTEM edits, no
promotion, no commit. New uncommitted runner + priced outputs + report.

PURPOSE
Price F6 counterfactual job menus through EUROMOD using the CERTIFIED target-only
geometry that D-BEN proved faithful (each target household's counterfactual nodes
substituted into the FULL real 2016 singles population; all OTHER households held
at their actual stored state — this is batch-A, the production method, which
eliminates the RSA cross-household leakage by construction). Parallelize across
32 cores. This produces the priced consumption (ils_dispy_real) at every
counterfactual node that F6-RUN's access operator needs; it does NOT compute the
decomposition.

SCOPE (hard limits)
- SINGLES ONLY (singles_male + singles_female), 2016 cross-section (year_tag==2,
  n=1,676) — the ratified primary scope. NO couples (901-alt pricing is out of
  scope here; couples are the staged stretch goal).
- Stem: fr_p3a_bpool_engine_ready_staged_threeB1 at certified theta-hat.
- EUROMOD: FR_2015 / FR_2016_a3, via the build module (run_bpool_euromod_chunk:
  _SYSTEM_PAIRING / _CPI / _RAW_SCHEMA / EuromodRunner / _stamp_draw_ids). Reuse
  these EXACTLY; hardcode no system/CPI/schema constant.
- Carried constraints (binding): full-population batch per target (NOT sub-bands,
  NOT isolated nodes); counterfactual wage nominal before EUROMOD, real via phi_y
  after (no double deflation); authoritative yem identity yem=yem00+yemxp; cluster
  identity source_idorighh preserved.

FROZEN RNG (record verbatim; same scheme as F3-R/F4):
  S = 101 counterfactual nodes per household (row-count identical to the staged band)
  base_seed = 20260604 ; per-HH seed = base_seed + (uid % 1_000_000) ; PCG64
  draw ordering employment -> occupation -> hours -> Halton-wage; pin + record the
  Halton sub-seed.
  Theta-hash + spec-hash recorded in every output.

WHICH COUNTERFACTUAL THIS PRICES (read from the F6 design memo; do NOT invent the
operator here): this harness prices the ACCESS-equalized counterfactual node menus
and the ACTUAL (self) menus. The reference-covariate values defining "access-
equalized" are an INPUT to this harness (passed as a covariate-override spec); if
that spec is not yet ratified, run ONLY the self/actual menus for the preflight
identity gate and STOP before the equalized run, reporting that the equalized
covariate spec is required.

TASK 0 — PREFLIGHT GATE (5 HH per group, before any full run). The load-bearing step.
For 5 singles_male + 5 singles_female (record selection: first-by-uid + the 3
D-BEN anchors if in 2016):
  (a) CANONICALIZATION: apply the app-layer post-draw canonicalization to redrawn
      nodes (the DE canonicalize_post_draws analogue) BEFORE pricing. Confirm no
      non-employment row carries positive wage / stale hours / stale yem. Report
      the canonicalization touched-row count. If the canonicalization function is
      absent for this path, STOP and report (do not price uncanonicalized nodes).
  (b) IDENTITY GATE: build the "self" counterfactual = redraw with the override
      set to the household's OWN actual covariates, price target-only in the full
      2016 population, and confirm repriced ils_dispy reproduces the STORED
      ils_dispy for that household's existing nodes to <= 0.01 EUR. This is the
      override=actual parity the F6 design memo requires, now at the pricing layer.
  (c) RSA-LEAKAGE CONTROL: confirm target-only pricing reproduces the household's
      RSA (bsa00_s) with NO cross-household wobble (the D-BEN fix working: since
      others are held at actual, i_bsa00_cumpers_nw/w match the stored population).
  Report per-HH: canonicalization rows, identity max_abs (<=0.01 gate), RSA match.
  GATE: all 10 HH pass (a)+(b)+(c). STOP and report if any fail — do NOT launch
  the full run on an unvalidated pricing path.

TASK 1 — FULL PARALLEL RUN (only if Task 0 passes; only for menus whose covariate-
override spec is ratified). Price all 1,676 singles' counterfactual menus, one
target-only full-population EUROMOD pass per household, parallelized across 32
cores. Runner contract: atomic per-HH output (tmp+rename); per-HH manifest row
(uid, group, seed, n_nodes, n_canonicalized, identity_self_max_abs if computed,
runtime, theta/spec hash, output hash); fully resumable (skip completed by hash);
no retry/reseed on failure — record and continue. Checkpoint dir OUTSIDE
production/staged. Report wall-time + per-core throughput.

TASK 2 — OUTPUT + INTEGRITY.
Per-HH priced counterfactual nodes -> outputs/welfare/fastlane/f6_priced_cf/
  {group}/{uid}.parquet  (node: working, loc4, hours, wage_nominal, ils_dispy,
   ils_dispy_real via phi_y, bsa00_s, + the canonicalization flags)
Aggregate manifest -> outputs/welfare/fastlane/f6_price_b_manifest_v1.json
Report -> docs/jmp_methodology/RURO_welfare_F6PRICEB_pricing_report_v1.md
  with: Task-0 gate verdicts (all 10 HH), full-run wall-time + throughput,
  n households priced / failed, RSA-leakage confirmation at scale (spot-check a
  sample: target-only RSA has no cross-household drift), and explicit lines:
   PREFLIGHT GATE: pass/fail
   CANONICALIZATION APPLIED: yes/no
   IDENTITY (override=actual) <=0.01 EUR: pass/fail
   FULL RUN COMPLETE: n/1676
   READY FOR F6-RUN ACCESS OPERATOR: yes/no
